1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A crew at Curiosity's Mount Sharp needs a slope-aware walk.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Example stops only. Outcrops are not locked. Red means steeper than 20 degrees.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Primary goal: ancient lake mudstones. Boxwork ridges are the bonus stop.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Dose is time times Curiosity's RAD rate, plus a cached DONKI alert. Not a map of rocks.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Martian Mappers. NASA data. Lunar slope stand-in. Oxygen is a placeholder.
